\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The same sheets, columns and row order as the QuantStudio software\PYGZsq{}s Excel export (Sample Setup, Raw Data, Amplification Data, Multicomponent Data, analysis summaries, Results, Reagent Information), rebuilt from the .eds using the export configuration saved inside it.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}与 QuantStudio 软件 Excel 导出相同的工作表、列与行顺序（样品设置、原始数据、扩增数据、多组分数据、分析汇总、结果、试剂信息），依据 .eds 内保存的导出配置重建。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
