\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Baseline starts on (after a repair or service)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}基线起始日期（维修或保养后）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}new baseline\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}新基线\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}no runs since the new baseline date\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}新基线日期后没有运行\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}1 · Hardware\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}1 · 硬件\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}thermal, optics, mechanics — predictive maintenance\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}热、光学、机械 — 预测性维护\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · Software\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · 软件\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}embedded computer, analysis software, data integrity\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}嵌入式计算机、分析软件、数据完整性\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · Method\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · 方法\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}reagents, probes, assay behaviour\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}试剂、探针、检测表现\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · Operator\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · 操作人员\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}pipetting skill, consistency, forensic\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}移液技能、一致性、取证\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Heating rate (10–90 \PYGZpc{})\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加热速率（10–90 \PYGZpc{}）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}How fast the Peltier elements heat the block. Median of every heating step in the run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}帕尔帖元件加热模块的速度。取本次运行所有升温步骤的中位数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A slow fall over months is Peltier or thermal\PYGZhy{}interface ageing; the fitted line gives a conditional limit\PYGZhy{}crossing estimate, not a failure date. A single low run points to the plate or a blocked vent that day.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}数月内缓慢下降表明帕尔帖元件或导热界面老化；趋势线可预测何时低于下限。单次偏低多与当天的板或通风口堵塞有关。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cooling rate (10–90 \PYGZpc{})\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}冷却速率（10–90 \PYGZpc{}）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}How well the heat sink and fans remove heat. Median of every cooling step.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}散热器和风扇带走热量的能力。取所有降温步骤的中位数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Falling cooling with stable heating = clogged fan filter or failing fan (clean the filters, check fans) before Peltier replacement.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加热正常而冷却下降 = 风扇滤网堵塞或风扇故障（先清洁滤网、检查风扇），再考虑更换帕尔帖元件。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Overshoot at the denaturation step\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}变性步骤的过冲\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Block temperature beyond the setpoint before it settles. The LC480 overshoots 4–6 °C by design, identically every cycle.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}模块温度在稳定前超过设定值的幅度。LC480 按设计每个循环都过冲 4–6 °C，且保持一致。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Watch for change, not size: a CUSUM drifting up or down means the controller or the temperature sensor has changed.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}关注变化而非大小：CUSUM 向上或向下漂移表示控制器或温度传感器发生了变化。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Settling time at the denaturation step\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}变性步骤的稳定时间\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Seconds from the 90 \PYGZpc{} point until the block stays within ±0.5 °C of the setpoint.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}从 90 \PYGZpc{} 点到模块稳定在设定值 ±0.5 °C 内所需的秒数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Longer settling with a normal ramp rate points to control tuning or sensor lag.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}升降温速率正常而稳定时间变长，提示控制参数或传感器滞后问题。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Temperature at the moment of reading\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}读数时的温度\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}°C from setpoint\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}与设定值的偏差 °C\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Offset (X̄) and stability (S) of the block while the camera reads, one subgroup per run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}相机读数时模块温度的偏差（X̄）和稳定性（S），每次运行为一个子组。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}X̄ drifting away from its usual offset = temperature calibration drift (verify with a temperature plate). S rising = unstable control.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}X̄ 偏离其通常偏差 = 温度校准漂移（用温度验证板确认）。S 上升 = 控制不稳定。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Block zone uniformity (95th percentile)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}模块分区均匀性（第 95 百分位）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Difference between the warmest and coolest of the six zones, 95th percentile over the run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}六个分区中最热与最冷之差，取整个运行的第 95 百分位。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}An EWMA creeping up means one zone is losing its match; look at the Temperature graph to find which.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}EWMA 缓慢上升表示某一分区逐渐失配；请在温度图中查找是哪一个分区。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Heat\PYGZhy{}sink maximum\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}散热器最高温度\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Highest heat\PYGZhy{}sink temperature during the run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行期间散热器的最高温度。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Rising over time with the same protocol = cooling capacity dropping (fans, dust, room temperature).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}同一程序下逐渐升高 = 散热能力下降（风扇、灰尘、室温）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Heated cover temperature\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}热盖温度\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Median cover temperature during the run (setpoint 105 °C).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行期间热盖温度的中位数（设定值 105 °C）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Below the setpoint = cover heater fault; condensation and evaporation follow.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}低于设定值 = 热盖加热器故障，随之出现冷凝和蒸发。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Xenon lamp intensity (reference channel)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}氙灯强度（参考通道）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}reference counts\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}参考计数\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The instrument measures the lamp through a reference channel. The first reading of each run tracks lamp ageing (manual: warning at 50 \PYGZpc{}, lifetime ≈ 500 h).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仪器通过参考通道测量灯的强度。每次运行的首次读数反映灯的老化（手册：50 \PYGZpc{} 时报警，寿命约 500 小时）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The fitted line predicts when 50 \PYGZpc{} of the starting value is reached — order the lamp before that. A point far below the line is a sudden lamp or light\PYGZhy{}guide fault.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}拟合线预测何时降至起始值的 50 \PYGZpc{} — 请在此之前订购新灯。明显低于拟合线的点表示灯或光导突发故障。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Lamp drift within a run\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行内的灯强度漂移\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}\PYGZpc{} change in the run\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行内变化 \PYGZpc{}\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}How much the lamp intensity changes during one run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}一次运行中灯强度的变化幅度。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Growing drift is typical of a lamp near the end of its life.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}漂移逐渐增大是灯接近寿命终点的典型表现。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}LED drive current\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}LED 驱动电流\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}current (as logged)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}电流（日志原值）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Median LED current during the run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行期间 LED 电流的中位数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The instrument raises current to keep light output: a rising trend is LED ageing; the line predicts when it reaches the limit you set.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仪器会提高电流以维持光输出：上升趋势表示 LED 老化；拟合线可预测何时达到您设定的限值。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}LED junction temperature (maximum)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}LED 结温（最高值）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Hottest LED junction temperature in the run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行中 LED 结温的最高值。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Higher than usual = LED cooling problem; LEDs age faster when hot.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}高于平常 = LED 散热问题；LED 在高温下老化更快。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Automatic integration time / exposure\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}自动积分时间 / 曝光时间\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Both instruments lengthen exposure automatically when the signal is weak.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}信号较弱时，两种仪器都会自动延长曝光时间。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A slow rise is compatible with weaker signal; verify matched controls and optical configuration before attributing ageing (compare with B\PYGZhy{}H8/B\PYGZhy{}H10); a jump after a reagent change points to the method instead.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}缓慢上升证实光源老化（与 B\PYGZhy{}H8/B\PYGZhy{}H10 对照）；更换试剂后出现跳变则指向方法问题。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Saturated well images\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}饱和孔图像\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}share of well images\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}孔图像比例\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Share of well images with at least one saturated pixel.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}至少含一个饱和像素的孔图像比例。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A rise = exposure logic or camera fault, or overloaded samples; values above zero make the curve plateau unreliable.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}上升 = 曝光逻辑或相机故障，或样品过载；大于零时曲线平台不可靠。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Uniformity calibration: edge\PYGZhy{}to\PYGZhy{}centre ratio\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}均匀性校准：边缘与中心之比\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}edge / centre\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}边缘 / 中心\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Changes only when the instrument is recalibrated.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仅在仪器重新校准时变化。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A step at a recalibration shows how much the optics changed; a large step deserves a service question.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}重新校准时的阶跃反映光学系统的变化程度；阶跃较大时应咨询维修服务。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Background calibration: mean offset\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}背景校准：平均偏移\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}counts\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}计数\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Mean absolute background offset of the last background calibration.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}最近一次背景校准的平均绝对背景偏移。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Rising between calibrations = contamination of the block or optics.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}两次校准之间上升 = 模块或光学系统受到污染。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Well\PYGZhy{}position (ROI) calibration: spot diameter\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}孔位（ROI）校准：光斑直径\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}pixels\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}像素\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Mean spot diameter from the ROI calibration.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}ROI 校准得到的平均光斑直径。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A change means the optical alignment moved.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}发生变化表示光学对准发生了移动。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Filter\PYGZhy{}wheel move time\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}滤光轮移动时间\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Median time of a filter\PYGZhy{}wheel move.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}滤光轮单次移动时间的中位数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Slower moves = motor or bearing wear.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}移动变慢 = 电机或轴承磨损。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Filter\PYGZhy{}wheel moves slower than 500 ms\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}滤光轮移动慢于 500 ms\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}share of moves\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}移动比例\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Share of moves longer than 500 ms (normal ≈ 300 ms).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}移动时间超过 500 ms 的比例（正常约 300 ms）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Occasional stalls come before a failure; any upward trend is worth a service call.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}偶发卡顿往往先于故障出现；任何上升趋势都值得联系维修。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Filter\PYGZhy{}wheel position offset\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}滤光轮位置偏移\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}encoder counts\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}编码器计数\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Encoder offset after each move; constant for a healthy wheel.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每次移动后的编码器偏移；轮子正常时保持恒定。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Any step = the wheel slipped, was re\PYGZhy{}homed or serviced.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}任何阶跃 = 轮子打滑、重新归零或经过维修。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Camera readout time beyond the exposure\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}超出曝光时间的相机读出时间\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}About 0.5 s per image; one subgroup = all images of the run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每幅图像约 0.5 s；一个子组 = 本次运行的全部图像。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A jump = camera or its interface; a slow rise = controller slowing (compare with software charts).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}跳变 = 相机或其接口问题；缓慢上升 = 控制器变慢（与软件图表对照）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Channel switch time\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}通道切换时间\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Time between the channels of one reading, net of integration (≈ 1.0–1.4 s; filter switch \PYGZlt{} 0.65 s by the manual).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}一次读数中各通道之间的时间，扣除积分时间（约 1.0–1.4 s；手册规定滤光片切换 \PYGZlt{} 0.65 s）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Rising = filter wheels or camera readout slowing.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}上升 = 滤光轮或相机读出变慢。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Heated cover lowering time\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}热盖下降时间\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Motorised cover pressing onto the plate (≈ 10 s).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}电动热盖压到板上的时间（约 10 s）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Getting slower = motor or linkage wear, or plates/seals that are too tall.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}变慢 = 电机或连杆磨损，或板/封膜过高。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Heated cover raising time\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}热盖抬起时间\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cover lifting off the plate (≈ 5.4 s).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}热盖从板上抬起的时间（约 5.4 s）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}As B\PYGZhy{}H18.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}同 B\PYGZhy{}H18。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Background fluorescence per channel\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}各通道背景荧光\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}fluorescence\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}荧光\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Median background of all wells, per channel.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}各通道所有孔背景的中位数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Slow decline = light source ageing; a raised run = plate, seal or contamination.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}缓慢下降 = 光源老化；某次运行偏高 = 板、封膜或污染。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}End\PYGZhy{}point fluorescence per channel\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}各通道终点荧光\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Median end\PYGZhy{}point of all wells, per channel.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}各通道所有孔终点荧光的中位数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Moves together with B\PYGZhy{}H8/B\PYGZhy{}H10 when optics age; alone it points to the method (probe) — see M\PYGZhy{}group.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}在光学老化时与 B\PYGZhy{}H8/B\PYGZhy{}H10 一起变化；单独变化则指向方法（探针）— 见方法组。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Run duration\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行时长\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}minutes\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}分钟\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Only comparable between runs of the same protocol.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仅在相同程序的运行之间可比。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A much shorter or longer run with the same protocol = aborted, paused or held run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}相同程序下运行时间明显偏短或偏长 = 运行中止、暂停或等待。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Reply time to the PC software\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}对 PC 软件的响应时间\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}ms (95th pct)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}ms（第 95 百分位）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}How fast the embedded computer answers commands.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}嵌入式计算机响应命令的速度。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Rising = controller overloaded or network problem.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}上升 = 控制器过载或网络问题。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Once\PYGZhy{}per\PYGZhy{}second timer lateness\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每秒定时器延迟\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}How late the 1\PYGZhy{}s housekeeping timer fires.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}1 秒周期的维护定时器触发延迟了多少。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Rising = the embedded CPU is saturated (mostly while imaging).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}上升 = 嵌入式 CPU 饱和（多发生在成像时）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Scheduler falling behind\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}调度器落后\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}events per run hour\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每运行小时事件数\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}How often the task scheduler had to catch up, per hour of run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}任务调度器需要追赶进度的频率（每运行小时）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A u\PYGZhy{}chart above its limit = the internal computer is overloaded.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}u 图超出限值 = 内部计算机过载。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Image → processing delay\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}图像 → 处理延迟\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Time from the last image to the start of its processing.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}从最后一幅图像到开始处理的时间。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Rising = storage or CPU slowing; one long delay is a single stall.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}上升 = 存储或 CPU 变慢；单次长延迟为一次卡顿。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Image analysis time\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}图像分析时间\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The software\PYGZsq{}s own processing time per image.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}软件自身报告的每幅图像处理时间。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A step after an update = different firmware behaviour (see version markers).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}更新后出现阶跃 = 固件行为改变（见版本标记）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Run\PYGZhy{}time prediction error\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行时间预测误差\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Actual minus predicted run time.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}实际运行时间减去预测时间。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Creeping up = actions take longer than the firmware expects.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}逐渐上升 = 各项操作耗时超过固件预期。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Data hand\PYGZhy{}off time\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}数据交接时间\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Minutes from run end until the data were packed for the PC.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}从运行结束到数据打包交给 PC 的分钟数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Long = network or PC problem, or a manual delay.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}过长 = 网络或 PC 问题，或人为延迟。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Command errors in the instrument log\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仪器日志中的命令错误\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}errors\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}错误\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Count of command errors per run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每次运行的命令错误数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}New or more errors = firmware or configuration change.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}出现新错误或错误增多 = 固件或配置变化。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cycle\PYGZhy{}timing regularity\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}循环计时规律性\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Standard deviation of the cycle period within a run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行内循环周期的标准差。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Larger = scheduling problems in the instrument.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}变大 = 仪器内部调度问题。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Temperature\PYGZhy{}log intervals over 500 ms\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}温度日志间隔超过 500 ms\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}share of intervals\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}间隔比例\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Regularity of the control\PYGZhy{}loop logging.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}控制回路记录的规律性。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Any rise = controller overload.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}任何上升 = 控制器过载。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Invalid fluorescence readings\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}无效荧光读数\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}share of readings\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}读数比例\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Readings the instrument marked invalid.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仪器标记为无效的读数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Above zero = acquisition fault.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}大于零 = 采集故障。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Stored Ct not reproducible (\PYGZgt{} 0.2)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}保存的 Ct 无法复现（\PYGZgt{} 0.2）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}share of wells\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}孔比例\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Wells whose stored Ct differs from the recalculation.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}保存的 Ct 与重新计算值不同的孔。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Non\PYGZhy{}zero requires checking algorithm, precision, stored settings and provenance; it does not establish post\PYGZhy{}analysis editing.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}不为零 = 分析后设置或数据被修改（需取证跟进）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Run end → last change\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行结束 → 最后修改\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}log10 hours\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}log10 小时\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Processing delay on a log scale (0 = 1 h, 1 = 10 h, 2 = 100 h).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}对数刻度的处理延迟（0 = 1 小时，1 = 10 小时，2 = 100 小时）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Points above the limit are late edits; cross\PYGZhy{}check with the operator group.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}高于限值的点为延迟编辑；请与操作人员组图表交叉核对。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Forensic findings per run\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每次运行的取证发现\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}findings\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}发现\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Count of review and error findings for the run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}本次运行的待审核和错误发现数量。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A run above the limit needs a closer look in the forensic log.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}高于限值的运行需要在取证日志中仔细查看。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Positive control Cq (Levey\PYGZhy{}Jennings)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}阳性对照 Cq（Levey\PYGZhy{}Jennings）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Mean Cq of the positive control per run and target, with Westgard rules.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每次运行、每个靶标阳性对照的平均 Cq，应用 Westgard 规则。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Across\PYGZhy{}run rules flag unexpected control behaviour. R\PYGZhy{}4s is not applied to run means. Investigate lot, extraction batch, assay and instrument effects.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}跨运行规则提示异常；不对运行均值应用 R\PYGZhy{}4s。需检查批次、提取、方法和仪器因素。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Probe signal strength (positive control)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}探针信号强度（阳性对照）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Amplitude (plateau above background) of the same control each run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}同一对照每次运行的幅度（高于背景的平台值）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Falling with a stable Cq = probe or dye degradation (storage, freeze\PYGZhy{}thaw); a step at a lot change = the lot. Compare with B\PYGZhy{}H8/B\PYGZhy{}H10 to exclude the optics.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cq 稳定而信号下降 = 探针或染料降解（储存、反复冻融）；更换批号时出现阶跃 = 批号问题。与 B\PYGZhy{}H8/B\PYGZhy{}H10 对照以排除光学原因。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Passive reference (ROX) level\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}被动参比（ROX）水平\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}passive reference\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}被动参比\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Median passive\PYGZhy{}reference level of named wells.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}已命名孔被动参比水平的中位数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A step = new master\PYGZhy{}mix lot or ROX concentration.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}阶跃 = 新的预混液批号或 ROX 浓度变化。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}PCR efficiency from the standards\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}由标准品得到的 PCR 效率\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}\PYGZpc{} efficiency\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}效率 \PYGZpc{}\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Efficiency of the standard curve per run and target.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每次运行、每个靶标标准曲线的效率。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A slow drop = degrading standard or reagent; outside 90–110 \PYGZpc{} fails MIQE\PYGZhy{}style acceptance.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}缓慢下降 = 标准品或试剂降解；超出 90–110 \PYGZpc{} 不符合 MIQE 风格的验收标准。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}NTC / blank positives\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}NTC / 空白阳性\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}share of NTC wells\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}NTC 孔比例\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Share of negative\PYGZhy{}control wells with any Cq.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}出现任何 Cq 的阴性对照孔比例。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Rising = contamination of reagents or of the working area (ISFG, MIQE).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}上升 = 试剂或工作区域受到污染（ISFG、MIQE）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Internal\PYGZhy{}control shift (inhibition)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}内控偏移（抑制）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}cycles\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}循环\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Mean IC Cq shift from the configured fixed reference. Missing reference means unavailable; endogenous taxon targets are not fixed\PYGZhy{}input IPCs.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}样品内控 Cq 相对运行中位数的平均偏移。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Upward drift = extraction method or kit problem.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}向上漂移 = 提取方法或试剂盒问题。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Low Cq confidence\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cq 置信度低\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Share of wells flagged for low Cq confidence.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}标记为 Cq 置信度低的孔比例。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A rise = noisy curves, often probe or baseline problems.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}上升 = 曲线噪声大，常见于探针或基线问题。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Late signal / stochastic\PYGZhy{}zone results\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}晚期信号 / 随机区结果\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}share of results\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}结果比例\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Share of sample results falling in the late\PYGZhy{}signal or low\PYGZhy{}quantity zone.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}落在晚期信号区或低定量区的样品结果比例。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A rise = sensitivity drop or poorer samples.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}上升 = 灵敏度下降或样品质量变差。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Replicate precision (pooled SD, Cq \PYGZlt{} 30)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}重复孔精密度（合并标准差，Cq \PYGZlt{} 30）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cq SD\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cq 标准差\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Pipetting precision; replicates above Cq 30 are left out so stochastic noise does not hide skill.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}移液精密度；Cq 30 以上的重复孔不计入，以免随机噪声掩盖技能差异。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}One operator\PYGZsq{}s points above the others → retraining; everyone rising → pipette calibration.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}某位操作人员的点高于其他人 → 再培训；所有人都上升 → 移液器校准。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Dispensed\PYGZhy{}volume spread (ROX CV)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加样体积离散度（ROX CV）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Raw passive\PYGZhy{}reference level varies with the dispensed volume.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}被动参比的原始水平随加样体积变化。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}High CV = uneven pipetting or bubbles.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}CV 高 = 移液不均匀或有气泡。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Row / column pattern\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}行 / 列模式\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Largest mean Cq offset of a plate row or column.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}板上某一行或某一列的最大平均 Cq 偏移。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}One row or column off = a faulty multichannel tip or loading\PYGZhy{}order error.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}某行或某列偏移 = 多道移液器某个吸头故障或加样顺序错误。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Contamination rate by operator (funnel)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}按操作人员的污染率（漏斗图）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}NTC positives per operator against the number of NTCs they ran.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每位操作人员的 NTC 阳性数与其所做 NTC 总数的对比。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Outside the 99.8 \PYGZpc{} line → investigate; the funnel keeps small workloads from looking unfair.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}超出 99.8 \PYGZpc{} 线 → 调查；漏斗图可避免工作量小的人员显得不公平。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Repeat / inconclusive / invalid rate by operator (funnel)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}按操作人员的重复 / 不确定 / 无效率（漏斗图）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Analytical robustness per person.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每个人的分析稳健性。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}As B\PYGZhy{}O5.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}同 B\PYGZhy{}O5。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Manual interventions\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}人工干预\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}share of settings\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}设置比例\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Share of settings or wells changed by hand.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}人工修改的设置或孔所占比例。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}High or rising → ask for documented reasons (OIG report lessons); compare operators with the funnel view.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}偏高或上升 → 要求提供书面理由（OIG 报告的经验）；用漏斗图比较操作人员。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Stored calls that disagree with the SOP\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}与 SOP 不一致的保存判定\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Consistency and fairness: do calls follow the written rules?\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}一致性与公平性：判定是否遵循书面规则？\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Disagreement concentrated in one person or case type → training or bias check.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}不一致集中在某个人或某类案例 → 培训或偏倚核查。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Copied\PYGZhy{}data events\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}复制数据事件\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}events\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}事件\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Must be zero.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}必须为零。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Any event is a forensic finding.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}任何事件都是一项取证发现。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}1 · Load files\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}1 · 加载文件\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · SOP\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · SOP\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · Results\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · 结果\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · Control panel\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · 控制面板\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · Graphs\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · 图表\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · Quality \PYGZam{} forensic review\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · 质量与取证审核\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}7 · Open formats\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}7 · 开放格式\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · Control panel\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · 控制面板\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · Load\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · 加载\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · Graphs\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · 图表\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · Quality \PYGZam{} forensic review\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · 质量与取证审核\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · Open formats\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · 开放格式\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Hardware, software, method and operator control charts per instrument. Click a tile for the chart and its settings.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}按仪器显示硬件、软件、方法和操作人员控制图。点击卡片查看图表及其设置。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}One graph at a time for a single run, drawn with the SOP limits.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每次显示单个运行的一张图，按 SOP 限值绘制。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · Review\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · 审核\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Control panel\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}控制面板\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Control charts for predictive maintenance and quality control, one instrument at a time. Each tile is one chart built from numbers the instrument wrote into its own files; the dot shows its state on the latest run (green in control, amber watch, red alarm, grey not enough data). Click a tile to open the chart, how to read it and its settings.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}用于预测性维护和质量控制的控制图，每次显示一台仪器。每张卡片是一张控制图，数据来自仪器自己写入文件的数值；圆点表示最近一次运行的状态（绿色受控，琥珀色需关注，红色报警，灰色数据不足）。点击卡片可打开图表、解读说明及其设置。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Instrument\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仪器\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}All charts\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}全部图表\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Only charts that need attention\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仅显示需关注的图表\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
