\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The block moves between these two temperatures faster than usual: after a service, a cleaned fan filter or a cooler room. Harmless; if it coincides with a step in overshoot or offset, start a new baseline on the service date.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加热块在这两个温度之间的移动比平时快：维修、清洁风扇过滤网或室温较低之后。无害；若与过冲或偏移的阶跃同时出现，在维修日期设定新基线。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The block needs longer to move between these two temperatures, so every cycle spends less time at the programmed hold. A cooling transition (e.g. 95 → 60 °C) getting longer = heat removal (clean fan filters, check fans, room temperature); heating transitions getting longer = Peltier ageing. Samples spend more time at intermediate temperatures, which can favour non\PYGZhy{}specific annealing.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加热块在这两个温度之间移动所需时间变长，每个循环在设定保持温度的时间减少。降温转换（如 95 → 60 °C）变长 = 散热问题（清洁风扇过滤网、检查风扇、室温）；升温转换变长 = Peltier 老化。样品在中间温度停留更久，可能促进非特异性退火。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Heating is slower than usual. A single low run: plate not seated, wrong plate type, blocked air vents or a warm room that day. A slow fall over many runs: Peltier elements or thermal paste ageing — plan a thermal service before the specification (4.3 °C/s on the LightCycler) is reached.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加热比平时慢。单次偏低：当天板未放好、板型错误、通风口堵塞或室温偏高。多次运行缓慢下降：Peltier 元件或导热膏老化 — 在达到规格下限（LightCycler 为 4.3 °C/s）前安排热系统维护。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cooling is slower than usual: the heat sink is not getting rid of heat. First clean the fan filters and check that all fans run and the vents are free; then check room temperature. If cooling keeps falling while heating stays normal after cleaning, the Peltier/heat\PYGZhy{}sink contact needs service.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}冷却比平时慢：散热器散热不足。先清洁风扇过滤网，检查所有风扇运转、通风口畅通；再检查室温。清洁后若冷却仍持续下降而加热正常，需维修 Peltier/散热器接触。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The block overshoots less than it used to (CUSUM drifting down). The temperature controller or the sensor calibration has changed — typical after a service or recalibration. Check that the reading temperature (B\PYGZhy{}H4) did not shift at the same time.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加热块过冲比以往小（CUSUM 向下漂移）。温度控制器或传感器校准已改变 — 常见于维修或重新校准后。检查读数时温度（B\PYGZhy{}H4）是否同时偏移。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The block reaches a stable temperature faster than usual. Harmless in itself; if it coincides with a step in overshoot and offset, the controller was re\PYGZhy{}tuned or recalibrated (start a new baseline).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加热块比平时更快达到稳定温度。本身无害；若与过冲和偏移的阶跃同时出现，说明控制器已重新调整或校准（设定新基线）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}At the moment of reading the block is colder than usual compared with the setpoint (more negative offset). Real sample temperature is lower: annealing becomes less stringent. Check cooling (B\PYGZhy{}H2) and room temperature; persistent change needs a temperature verification plate or recalibration. S above its limit = temperature not stable during the reading.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}读数时加热块相对设定值比平时更冷（偏移更负）。实际样品温度更低：退火严格性降低。检查冷却（B\PYGZhy{}H2）和室温；持续变化需用温度验证板或重新校准。S 超限 = 读数期间温度不稳定。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The six block zones agree better than usual. Harmless; typical after a block service or recalibration.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}六个区域温度一致性比平时更好。无害；常见于加热块维修或校准后。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The heat sink stays cooler than usual: cooler room or cleaned fans/filters. Harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}散热器温度比平时低：室温较低或风扇/过滤网已清洁。无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The heated cover is colder than its setpoint: condensation can form under the seal and change reaction volumes. Check that the cover heats and that the run was not started with the cover disabled; recurring = cover heater service.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}热盖温度低于设定值：封膜下可能形成冷凝，改变反应体积。检查热盖是否加热、运行是否在关闭热盖的情况下启动；反复出现 = 维修热盖加热器。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The lamp reference reading is lower than usual: less light reaches the reference sensor. Lamp near the end of its range, light guide or filter dirty, or the lamp was not warmed up. Check lamp intensity \PYGZpc{} and hours in Tools → Instruments.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}灯参考读数比平时低：到达参考传感器的光减少。灯接近寿命末期、光导或滤光片脏污，或灯未充分预热。在 Tools → Instruments 中检查灯强度 \PYGZpc{} 和使用小时数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Lamp output falls during the run more than usual: the lamp is unstable (ageing) or was not warmed up. Late\PYGZhy{}cycle fluorescence may be under\PYGZhy{}reported; check the lamp.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行中灯输出下降超过平常：灯不稳定（老化）或未充分预热。后期循环荧光可能偏低；检查灯。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The LED is driven with less current than usual: either the LED is brighter than expected (after a service) or the driver is limiting. Check that signal levels (A\PYGZhy{}H3) did not drop.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}LED 驱动电流比平时低：LED 比预期更亮（维修后）或驱动器限流。检查信号水平（A\PYGZhy{}H3）是否下降。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The LED runs cooler than usual: cooler room or improved airflow. Harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}LED 结温比平时低：室温较低或气流改善。无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Shorter exposures than usual: the signal is brighter (more template, new reagent lot, higher probe concentration) or the light source is stronger after a service. Check for saturation (B\PYGZhy{}H12).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}曝光时间比平时短：信号更亮（模板更多、新试剂批次、探针浓度更高）或维修后光源更强。检查饱和（B\PYGZhy{}H12）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer saturated images than usual: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}饱和图像比平时少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The new uniformity calibration shows the plate edges relatively darker than before: optics or illumination changed. Check that the calibration was done with the correct plate, and watch for edge effects in the results.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}新的均一性校准显示板边缘相对以前更暗：光学或照明发生变化。检查校准是否使用了正确的板，并注意结果中的边缘效应。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The background calibration offset is lower than before: cleaner block or new calibration plate. Harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}背景校准偏移比以前低：加热块更干净或使用了新校准板。无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The well spots found by the ROI calibration are smaller than before: focus or alignment changed. Wells may be read off\PYGZhy{}centre; repeat the ROI calibration.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}ROI 校准找到的孔光斑比以前小：焦距或对准发生变化。孔可能被偏心读取；重新进行 ROI 校准。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Filter\PYGZhy{}wheel moves are faster than usual: typical after a motor service or firmware change. Harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}滤光轮移动比平时快：常见于电机维修或固件更新后。无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer slow moves than usual: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}慢速移动比平时少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The filter\PYGZhy{}wheel position offset stepped down: the wheel slipped, was re\PYGZhy{}homed or serviced. Wrong filter positions change the signal in every channel; check the dye calibration if unexplained.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}滤光轮位置偏移向下阶跃：滤光轮打滑、重新归位或维修过。滤光片位置错误会改变所有通道的信号；如无法解释，检查染料校准。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Camera readout is faster than usual: firmware or controller change. Harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}相机读出比平时快：固件或控制器变化。无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Switching between channels is faster than usual: firmware or mechanical change. Harmless, but note it.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}通道切换比平时快：固件或机械变化。无害，但应记录。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The cover lowers faster than usual: typical after lubrication or a drive service. Harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}热盖下降比平时快：常见于润滑或驱动维修后。无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The cover rises faster than usual: harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}热盖上升比平时快：无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Background fluorescence is lower than usual: less dye or probe in the wells, a different plate or seal, less volume, or weaker excitation. Check reagent preparation and the exposure chart (B\PYGZhy{}H11).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}背景荧光比平时低：孔中染料或探针减少、板或封膜不同、体积减少或激发光减弱。检查试剂配制和曝光图（B\PYGZhy{}H11）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}End\PYGZhy{}point fluorescence is lower than usual: weaker amplification (inhibition, degraded reagents, less template) or weaker optics. If the positive\PYGZhy{}control Cq is normal, suspect the probe or the optics.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}终点荧光比平时低：扩增变弱（抑制、试剂降解、模板减少）或光学变弱。若阳性对照 Cq 正常，怀疑探针或光学部件。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The run finished faster than usual for this protocol: the run was stopped early or cycles were skipped. Check the run was complete before accepting results.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}该程序运行比平时快：运行被提前停止或跳过了循环。接受结果前确认运行完整。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The instrument answers the PC faster than usual: harmless (firmware or PC change).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仪器响应 PC 比平时快：无害（固件或 PC 变化）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The 1\PYGZhy{}s timer fires more punctually than usual: harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}1 秒定时器比平时更准时：无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The scheduler falls behind less often: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}调度器落后的次数减少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Images are processed sooner than usual: harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}图像处理比平时更早开始：无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Image analysis is faster than usual: harmless (firmware update).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}图像分析比平时快：无害（固件更新）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The run finished earlier than the software predicted: the prediction model changed, or the run was shortened. Check that the run completed.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行比软件预测的更早结束：预测模型改变或运行被缩短。确认运行已完成。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Data were packed for the PC faster than usual: harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}数据比平时更快打包给 PC：无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer command errors than usual: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}命令错误比平时少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cycles are more regular than usual: harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}循环比平时更规律：无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer late temperature\PYGZhy{}log intervals: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}温度日志延迟间隔减少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer invalid readings: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}无效读数减少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer wells whose stored Ct cannot be reproduced: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}存储 Ct 无法复现的孔减少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Results were finalised sooner after the run than usual: good practice.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行后结果定稿比平时更快：良好做法。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer forensic findings than usual: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}法证发现比平时少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The positive control amplified earlier than its range: more control template (new lot, pipetting), contamination, or a more efficient reaction. Westgard rules decide whether the run is rejected; check the control lot and pipetting.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}阳性对照扩增早于其范围：对照模板更多（新批次、移液）、污染或反应效率更高。由 Westgard 规则决定是否拒绝该运行；检查对照批次和移液。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The probe signal of the control is weaker than usual: probe degradation (light, freeze–thaw), a new lot with less signal, wrong dye/quencher setup or weaker optics. Weak signal makes Cq calls less reliable; check reagent storage and lot.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}对照的探针信号比平时弱：探针降解（光照、反复冻融）、新批次信号较弱、染料/淬灭剂设置错误或光学变弱。信号弱会降低 Cq 判读可靠性；检查试剂储存和批次。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The passive reference (ROX) is lower than usual: less master mix dispensed, a master mix without or with less ROX, or wrong dye settings. Normalised results may be noisier; check the master mix and pipetting.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}被动参比（ROX）比平时低：分配的预混液减少、预混液不含或含较少 ROX，或染料设置错误。归一化结果可能更嘈杂；检查预混液和移液。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}PCR efficiency is lower than usual (below 90 \PYGZpc{} is outside MIQE): inhibition, degraded reagents, poor primer/probe, or wrong dilutions of the standards. Quantities will be biased; repeat the standard curve.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}PCR 效率比平时低（低于 90 \PYGZpc{} 超出 MIQE）：抑制、试剂降解、引物/探针不佳或标准品稀释错误。定量将有偏差；重做标准曲线。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer positive negative controls than usual: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}阳性阴性对照比平时少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The internal control in samples amplifies earlier than the configured fixed reference Cq. Check control input, assay settings and reference applicability before attributing a cause.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}样品中的内对照扩增早于运行中位数：加入的内对照更多，或中位数受抑制样品影响。通常无害；检查内对照加量。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer low\PYGZhy{}confidence Cq calls: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}低置信度 Cq 减少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer results in the late or stochastic zone: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}晚期或随机区的结果减少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Replicates agree better than usual: good pipetting. Harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}重复孔一致性比平时好：移液良好。无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The dispensed volume is more even than usual: good. Harmless.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}分配体积比平时更均匀：良好。无害。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}(A lower value is always good — no action.)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}（值越低越好 — 无需处理。）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}(Below the funnel is not possible for a rate — no action.)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}（比率不可能低于漏斗 — 无需处理。）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer manual changes than usual: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}手动修改比平时少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Fewer calls disagree with the SOP: normal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}与 SOP 不一致的判读减少：正常。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}(Zero is the expected value.)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}（期望值为零。）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Heating is faster than usual. Usually harmless: after a service, a new block or a firmware change. If isolated, check the run used the same protocol and plate; very fast ramps with a larger overshoot can stress samples.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加热比平时快。通常无害：维修、更换加热块或固件更新之后。若为孤立点，检查该运行是否使用相同程序和板型；过快的升温伴随更大过冲可能影响样品。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cooling is faster than usual. Typical after cleaning the filters, a fan replacement or a service, or in a cooler room. Note the event and, if it was a service, start a new baseline on that date.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}冷却比平时快。常见于清洁过滤网、更换风扇或维修之后，或室温较低时。记录该事件；如为维修，在该日期设定新基线。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The block overshoots more than it used to (CUSUM drifting up). The controller is compensating for a slower block, or the sensor is ageing. Samples briefly see higher temperatures; check heating rate (B\PYGZhy{}H1) and plan a temperature verification.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加热块过冲比以往大（CUSUM 向上漂移）。控制器在补偿变慢的加热块，或传感器老化。样品会短暂承受更高温度；检查加热速率（B\PYGZhy{}H1）并安排温度验证。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The block needs longer to settle. With normal ramp rates: control tuning or sensor lag. With slower ramps as well: thermal ageing. Long settling shortens the real hold time at the setpoint and can lower efficiency.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加热块稳定所需时间变长。升降温速率正常时：控制参数或传感器滞后。升降温同时变慢时：热系统老化。稳定时间过长会缩短在设定温度的实际保持时间，可能降低扩增效率。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}At the moment of reading the block is warmer than usual compared with the setpoint. Real sample temperature is higher: annealing is more stringent and weakly binding probes can lose signal. Typical after a recalibration (start a new baseline); otherwise verify with a temperature plate. S above its limit = temperature not stable during the reading.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}读数时加热块相对设定值比平时更热。实际样品温度更高：退火更严格，结合较弱的探针可能信号降低。常见于重新校准后（设定新基线）；否则用温度验证板核实。S 超限 = 读数期间温度不稳定。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The block zones disagree more than usual: wells in different parts of the plate see different temperatures, which shows up as edge or row/column Cq patterns (B\PYGZhy{}O3). Check plate seating and seal; if it persists or exceeds 1.5 °C, request a block uniformity service.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}各区域温差比平时大：板上不同位置的孔温度不同，表现为边缘或行/列 Cq 模式（B\PYGZhy{}O3）。检查板放置和封膜；若持续或超过 1.5 °C，申请加热块均一性维修。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The heat sink runs hotter than usual: airflow is reduced (dust in filters, failing fan, instrument too close to a wall) or the room is warm. Expect slower cooling (B\PYGZhy{}H2). Clean filters, check fans and clearance.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}散热器温度比平时高：气流减少（过滤网积尘、风扇故障、仪器离墙太近）或室温偏高。冷却会变慢（B\PYGZhy{}H2）。清洁过滤网，检查风扇和间距。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The heated cover is warmer than its setpoint: control fault or sensor error. Seals can deform; report to service if repeated.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}热盖温度高于设定值：控制故障或传感器误差。封膜可能变形；反复出现请联系维修。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The lamp reference reading is higher than usual: typically a new lamp or a service (start a new baseline). Otherwise a reference\PYGZhy{}sensor fault; check the lamp intensity \PYGZpc{} in the instrument software.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}灯参考读数比平时高：通常是换了新灯或维修（设定新基线）。否则为参考传感器故障；在仪器软件中检查灯强度 \PYGZpc{}。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Lamp output rises during the run more than usual: the lamp was still warming up at the start, or it flickers. Early\PYGZhy{}cycle baselines can be affected; allow warm\PYGZhy{}up and check the lamp.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行中灯输出上升超过平常：开始时灯仍在预热，或灯闪烁。早期循环基线可能受影响；确保预热并检查灯。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The LED needs more current than usual to give the same light: normal LED ageing. The trend line forecasts when the driver will reach its limit — plan an optics service before that.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}LED 需要比平时更大的电流才能输出相同光强：LED 正常老化。趋势线预测驱动器何时达到极限 — 在此之前安排光学维修。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The LED runs hotter than usual: reduced cooling of the optics (fans, filters, room temperature) or higher drive current (B\PYGZhy{}H10). Heat shortens LED life and can shift its colour; check airflow.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}LED 结温比平时高：光学部件冷却不足（风扇、过滤网、室温）或驱动电流升高（B\PYGZhy{}H10）。高温缩短 LED 寿命并可能改变光谱；检查气流。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Longer exposures than usual: the instrument is compensating for weak light — weaker probe or dye, wrong plate or seal, dirty optics, or an ageing lamp/LED. If it keeps rising over many runs, service the optics.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}曝光时间比平时长：仪器在补偿弱光 — 探针或染料变弱、板或封膜错误、光学部件脏污或灯/LED 老化。若多次运行持续上升，维修光学部件。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More well images are saturated: signal too strong for the camera (too much template or dye, wrong exposure settings, reflective plate). Saturated wells give wrong curve shapes and Cq; dilute samples or check the plate type.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}饱和的孔图像增多：信号对相机过强（模板或染料过多、曝光设置错误、反光板）。饱和孔的曲线形状和 Cq 不准确；稀释样品或检查板型。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The new uniformity calibration shows the edges relatively brighter than before: optics or illumination changed, or the calibration plate differed. Confirm with a repeat calibration before accepting it.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}新的均一性校准显示边缘相对以前更亮：光学或照明发生变化，或校准板不同。接受前请重复校准确认。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The background calibration offset is higher: contamination (fluorescent residue) on the block or optics, or a light leak. Clean the block, repeat the background calibration.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}背景校准偏移更高：加热块或光学部件有污染（荧光残留）或漏光。清洁加热块，重新进行背景校准。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The well spots are larger than before: focus or alignment changed, or a different plate type was used for calibration. Repeat the ROI calibration with the correct plate.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}孔光斑比以前大：焦距或对准发生变化，或校准使用了不同板型。用正确的板重新进行 ROI 校准。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Filter\PYGZhy{}wheel moves are slower: friction in the bearing, a weakening motor or dust. The wheel may start to miss positions (B\PYGZhy{}H15). Plan a service if the rise continues.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}滤光轮移动变慢：轴承摩擦、电机变弱或积尘。滤光轮可能开始定位偏差（B\PYGZhy{}H15）。若持续上升，安排维修。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More filter\PYGZhy{}wheel moves take longer than 500 ms: mechanical wear or intermittent motor problems, often before the median (B\PYGZhy{}H14) changes. Plan a service.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}超过 500 ms 的滤光轮移动增多：机械磨损或电机间歇性问题，通常早于中位数（B\PYGZhy{}H14）的变化。安排维修。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The filter\PYGZhy{}wheel position offset stepped up: the wheel slipped, was re\PYGZhy{}homed or serviced. Check the dye calibration if unexplained.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}滤光轮位置偏移向上阶跃：滤光轮打滑、重新归位或维修过。如无法解释，检查染料校准。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Camera readout takes longer than usual. A jump points to the camera or its connection; a slow rise, together with the software charts (B\PYGZhy{}S1–S4), points to the embedded computer slowing down.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}相机读出时间比平时长。突然跳升指向相机或其连接；缓慢上升且伴随软件图表（B\PYGZhy{}S1–S4）变化，指向嵌入式计算机变慢。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Switching between channels is slower: filter wheels, the camera readout or the instrument computer are slowing down. The manual allows \PYGZlt{} 0.65 s for the filter switch; if the rise continues, plan a service.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}通道切换变慢：滤光轮、相机读出或仪器计算机变慢。手册规定滤光片切换 \PYGZlt{} 0.65 s；若持续上升，安排维修。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The cover takes longer to lower: the drive mechanism is wearing or needs lubrication, or something obstructs it (tall plate, misplaced adapter). The trend forecasts when the drive will reach its limit.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}热盖下降时间变长：驱动机构磨损或需润滑，或有阻碍（板太高、适配器放错）。趋势线预测驱动何时达到极限。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The cover takes longer to rise: drive wear or the cover sticking to the seal. Check the seal type and the drive.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}热盖上升时间变长：驱动磨损或热盖粘在封膜上。检查封膜类型和驱动。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Background fluorescence is higher than usual: more probe or a degraded probe (free dye), fluorescent contamination, a different plate type, or a light leak. Check the reagent lot and plate type.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}背景荧光比平时高：探针过多或探针降解（游离染料）、荧光污染、板型不同或漏光。检查试剂批次和板型。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}End\PYGZhy{}point fluorescence is higher than usual: more template or probe, a new reagent lot, or a brighter light source after service. Check for saturation (B\PYGZhy{}H12).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}终点荧光比平时高：模板或探针更多、新试剂批次，或维修后光源更亮。检查饱和（B\PYGZhy{}H12）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The run took longer than usual for this protocol: slower ramps (B\PYGZhy{}H1/B\PYGZhy{}H2), longer exposures (B\PYGZhy{}H11), a pause, or the instrument computer slowing. Look at those charts for the same run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}该程序运行比平时慢：升降温变慢（B\PYGZhy{}H1/B\PYGZhy{}H2）、曝光变长（B\PYGZhy{}H11）、暂停或仪器计算机变慢。查看同一运行的相关图表。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The instrument answers the PC more slowly: embedded computer busy or ageing, storage slow, or network/USB problems. Rising together with B\PYGZhy{}S2/B\PYGZhy{}S3 = instrument computer; alone = PC or connection.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仪器响应 PC 变慢：嵌入式计算机繁忙或老化、存储慢或网络/USB 问题。与 B\PYGZhy{}S2/B\PYGZhy{}S3 同时上升 = 仪器计算机；单独上升 = PC 或连接。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The 1\PYGZhy{}s timer fires late: the embedded computer is overloaded or its storage is slow. Timing of steps and readings can drift; if it keeps rising, request a vendor check of the instrument computer.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}1 秒定时器延迟触发：嵌入式计算机过载或存储慢。步骤和读数的时间可能漂移；若持续上升，请厂商检查仪器计算机。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The task scheduler falls behind more often: the instrument computer cannot keep up. Watch reply time (B\PYGZhy{}S1) and processing delay (B\PYGZhy{}S3); a vendor check may be needed.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}任务调度器更频繁落后：仪器计算机跟不上。关注响应时间（B\PYGZhy{}S1）和处理延迟（B\PYGZhy{}S3）；可能需要厂商检查。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Images wait longer before processing: the instrument computer is busy, storage is slow or nearly full. Clear old data on the instrument; persistent rise = vendor check.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}图像处理前等待时间变长：仪器计算机繁忙、存储慢或接近满。清理仪器上的旧数据；持续上升 = 厂商检查。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Image analysis takes longer: the instrument computer is slowing (storage, memory) or the plate layout is heavier (more wells, more dyes). Compare with runs of the same plate layout.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}图像分析时间变长：仪器计算机变慢（存储、内存）或板布局更复杂（更多孔、更多染料）。与相同板布局的运行比较。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The run took longer than the software predicted: slower ramps, longer exposures or computer delays add up. Look at the thermal and software charts for the same run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行时间比软件预测的长：升降温变慢、曝光变长或计算机延迟累积。查看同一运行的热和软件图表。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Data were packed long after the run ended: the file was saved or transferred late (PC off, network down, run left on the instrument). For forensic review, check that nothing was changed in between.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行结束很久后数据才打包：文件保存或传输延迟（PC 关闭、网络中断、运行留在仪器上）。法证审查时，确认期间未做任何修改。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More command errors than usual: communication problems between PC and instrument, a firmware/software mismatch or a hardware fault. Read the instrument log for the run and contact service if it repeats.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}命令错误比平时多：PC 与仪器通信问题、固件/软件不匹配或硬件故障。查看该运行的仪器日志，反复出现请联系维修。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cycle length varies more within the run: the instrument paused, waited for the computer, or thermal steps took variable time. Irregular cycles can change Cq; check the run timeline graph.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行内循环时长波动变大：仪器暂停、等待计算机，或热步骤耗时不一。不规律的循环可能改变 Cq；查看运行时间线图。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More temperature\PYGZhy{}log intervals exceed 500 ms: the control loop is being interrupted — computer overload or a communication problem. Temperature control may be affected; check the thermal charts.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}超过 500 ms 的温度日志间隔增多：控制回路被打断 — 计算机过载或通信问题。温度控制可能受影响；查看热相关图表。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More fluorescence readings are marked invalid by the instrument: optics, lamp or camera problems, or the signal was out of range. Check exposure (B\PYGZhy{}H11) and lamp (B\PYGZhy{}H8); affected wells may need repeating.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}被仪器标记为无效的荧光读数增多：光学、灯或相机问题，或信号超出范围。检查曝光（B\PYGZhy{}H11）和灯（B\PYGZhy{}H8）；受影响的孔可能需要重做。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More wells have a stored Ct that the page cannot reproduce from the stored data: manual threshold or baseline changes, a software version change, or data edited after analysis. Check the analysis settings and the audit trail.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}存储 Ct 无法由存储数据复现的孔增多：手动修改了阈值或基线、软件版本变化，或分析后数据被编辑。检查分析设置和审计追踪。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The file was last changed much later than usual after the run: late analysis, or re\PYGZhy{}analysis long after the run. For forensic review, check who changed what and why (audit trail).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}文件最后修改时间比平时晚得多：分析延迟，或运行后很久重新分析。法证审查时，检查谁修改了什么以及原因（审计追踪）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More forensic findings than usual for one run: open the Quality \PYGZam{} forensic review tab for this run and resolve each finding before accepting the results.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}单次运行的法证发现比平时多：打开该运行的质量与法证审查页，在接受结果前逐项处理。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The positive control amplified later than its range: degraded control or reagents, inhibition, pipetting error, or weaker optics. A trend over several runs points to reagent storage or lot ageing; a single point to the run itself.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}阳性对照扩增晚于其范围：对照或试剂降解、抑制、移液错误或光学变弱。多次运行的趋势指向试剂储存或批次老化；单个点指向该运行本身。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The probe signal is stronger than usual: a new lot, higher probe concentration or a stronger light source. Check for saturation (B\PYGZhy{}H12) and that thresholds still suit the curves.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}探针信号比平时强：新批次、探针浓度更高或光源更强。检查饱和（B\PYGZhy{}H12）以及阈值是否仍适合曲线。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The passive reference is higher than usual: more volume, a master mix with more ROX, or evaporation concentrating the wells. Check the master mix type and the seal.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}被动参比比平时高：体积更大、预混液 ROX 更多，或蒸发使孔内浓缩。检查预混液类型和封膜。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}PCR efficiency is higher than usual (above 110 \PYGZpc{} is outside MIQE): usually a pipetting or dilution error in the standards, inhibition in the concentrated standards, or primer\PYGZhy{}dimers. Repeat the dilution series.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}PCR 效率比平时高（高于 110 \PYGZpc{} 超出 MIQE）：通常是标准品移液或稀释错误、高浓度标准品中的抑制或引物二聚体。重做稀释系列。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More no\PYGZhy{}template controls show a Cq: contamination (reagents, pipettes, bench, amplicon carry\PYGZhy{}over) or probe degradation giving false signal. Stop, decontaminate, replace reagents; results of affected runs need review.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}出现 Cq 的无模板对照增多：污染（试剂、移液器、台面、扩增产物残留）或探针降解产生假信号。停止工作、去污、更换试剂；受影响运行的结果需审查。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}The internal control in samples is delayed: inhibition from the sample matrix or extraction carry\PYGZhy{}over (ethanol, salts), or extraction losses. Affected samples may give false negatives; re\PYGZhy{}extract or dilute.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}样品中的内对照延迟：样品基质抑制或提取残留（乙醇、盐），或提取损失。受影响样品可能出现假阴性；重新提取或稀释。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More wells have low Cq confidence: noisy or odd\PYGZhy{}shaped curves from weak probes, bubbles, evaporation or low template. Review the flagged curves before reporting.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}低 Cq 置信度的孔增多：弱探针、气泡、蒸发或模板少导致的噪声或异常曲线。报告前审查被标记的曲线。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More results fall in the late\PYGZhy{}signal or stochastic zone: low template amounts, inhibition, degraded samples or less sensitive reagents. These results are less reliable; follow the SOP for repeats.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}落在晚期信号或随机区的结果增多：模板量低、抑制、样品降解或试剂灵敏度降低。这些结果可靠性较低；按 SOP 重复。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Replicates agree less than usual: pipetting imprecision (technique, uncalibrated pipette, bubbles), poor mixing or bad plate sealing. Check the pipette calibration and retrain if it is linked to one operator.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}重复孔一致性比平时差：移液不精确（技术、移液器未校准、气泡）、混合不充分或封板不良。检查移液器校准；若与某一操作人员相关，需再培训。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Dispensed volumes vary more across the plate: pipetting technique, a pipette out of calibration or a failing multichannel channel. Check the pipettes and the operator\PYGZsq{}s technique.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}板上分配体积差异变大：移液技术、移液器超出校准或多道移液器某通道故障。检查移液器和操作人员技术。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}One plate row or column differs from the rest: a blocked or faulty multichannel tip, a pipetting order error, or a block zone problem (B\PYGZhy{}H5). Look at the plate heat map to see which row or column.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}某一行或列与其他不同：多道移液器吸头堵塞或故障、移液顺序错误，或加热块区域问题（B\PYGZhy{}H5）。查看板热图以确定是哪一行或列。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}This operator\PYGZsq{}s NTC positive rate is higher than expected for their workload: outside 95 \PYGZpc{} = watch, outside 99.8 \PYGZpc{} = investigate the operator\PYGZsq{}s contamination\PYGZhy{}control technique (gloves, tips, workflow) and offer retraining.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}该操作人员的 NTC 阳性率高于其工作量下的预期：超出 95 \PYGZpc{} = 关注，超出 99.8 \PYGZpc{} = 调查其防污染技术（手套、吸头、流程）并提供再培训。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}This operator gets more repeats, inconclusive or invalid results than expected for their workload: check sample handling, pipetting and SOP understanding; use it for training, not ranking.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}该操作人员的重复、不确定或无效结果多于其工作量下的预期：检查样品处理、移液和对 SOP 的理解；用于培训而非排名。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More settings or wells were changed by hand (threshold, baseline, omitted wells, manual calls): the automatic analysis does not suit the data, or results were adjusted. Each change should be justified in the record.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}手动修改的设置或孔增多（阈值、基线、剔除孔、手动判读）：自动分析不适合数据，或结果被调整。每项修改都应在记录中说明理由。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}More stored calls disagree with the SOP rules: calls were made by hand, the software settings differ from the SOP, or the SOP profile loaded in the page is not the one in use. Review each disagreement.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}与 SOP 规则不一致的存储判读增多：判读为手动、软件设置与 SOP 不同，或页面加载的 SOP 配置不是实际使用的。逐项审查不一致之处。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Identical curves or Cq values were found where independent data are expected: copied or duplicated data. This is a forensic finding — secure the original files and investigate.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}在应为独立数据处发现相同的曲线或 Cq 值：数据被复制或重复。这是法证发现 — 保全原始文件并调查。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}What a result outside the limits means\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}超出限值的结果意味着什么\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}▼ Below the lower limit\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}▼ 低于下限\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}▲ Above the upper limit\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}▲ 高于上限\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Meaning\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}含义\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}▼ below\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}▼ 偏低\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}▲ above\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}▲ 偏高\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Direction\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}方向\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Below the limit\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}低于限值\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Above the limit\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}高于限值\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}1 · Load files\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}1 · 加载文件\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · SOP\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · SOP\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · Results\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · 结果\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · Control panel\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · 控制面板\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · Graphs\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · 图表\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · Quality \PYGZam{} forensic review\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · 质量与取证审核\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}7 · Open formats\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}7 · 开放格式\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · Control panel\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · 控制面板\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · Load\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · 加载\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · Graphs\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · 图表\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · Quality \PYGZam{} forensic review\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · 质量与取证审核\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · Open formats\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · 开放格式\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Drop the files. Integrity is checked on reading.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}拖入文件，读取时即校验完整性。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Pick or open your laboratory profile; outcomes and run acceptance follow it.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}选择或打开实验室配置文件，结果判定与运行验收均据此进行。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}One graph at a time, drawn with the SOP limits; download SVG, PNG or the data.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每次显示一张图，按 SOP 限值绘制；可下载 SVG、PNG 或数据。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · Review\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · 审核\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Forensic log, plate, controls, curves and instrument records.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}取证日志、板图、对照、曲线与仪器记录。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}One row per file. Open the Review tab for the forensic log.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每个文件一行。取证日志请见“审核”标签页。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cycles\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}循环数\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cq results\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cq 结果\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Tm results\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Tm 结果\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Active channels\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}有效通道\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Settings read from one experiment file (details)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}从单个实验文件读取的设置（详情）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Download for all runs (CSV)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}下载全部运行（CSV）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Laboratory SOP profile\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}实验室 SOP 配置文件\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}State your laboratory\PYGZsq{}s own acceptance and interpretation rules once, save them as a profile file and reuse it. The stored Cq values and calls are never changed; every outcome says which rule produced it, and every export carries the profile\PYGZsq{}s name, version and SHA\PYGZhy{}256.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}将本实验室的验收与结果解释规则一次性写好，保存为配置文件并重复使用。保存的 Cq 值与判定不会被修改；每个结果都注明产生它的规则，每个导出文件都带有配置文件的名称、版本与 SHA\PYGZhy{}256。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Start from\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}起始模板\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Generic qPCR (MIQE\PYGZhy{}style defaults)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}通用 qPCR（MIQE 风格默认值）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}GMO screening — qualitative (example)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}转基因筛查 — 定性（示例）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Forensic DNA quantification triage (example)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}法医 DNA 定量分流（示例）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Use this starting point\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}使用此模板\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Open profile (JSON)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}打开配置文件（JSON）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Save profile (JSON)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}保存配置文件（JSON）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Lock profile\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}锁定配置文件\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Results under this SOP\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}按此 SOP 得出的结果\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Run acceptance and the interpretation of every sample, recomputed as soon as the profile changes.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行验收与每个样品的结果解释，配置文件一经修改即重新计算。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}View\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}视图\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Sample report\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}样品报告\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Results by target\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}按靶标的结果\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
