\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Criterion\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}标准\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Result\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}结果\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}SOP action\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}SOP 处理\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Evidence\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}证据\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Status\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}状态\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Rejected by\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}拒收原因\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Review\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}审核\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Run started\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行开始\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Last change\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}最后修改\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Hours to last change\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}至最后修改的小时数\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Level\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}级别\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Every dated event the file carries: experiment creation, run start and end, analysis creation and edits, the last recorded change (for .eds, the newest ZIP entry date is the last save), instrument log and calibrations. Events more than 7 days from the run are listed in the table and marked at the edge.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}文件中所有带日期的事件：实验创建、运行开始与结束、分析创建与编辑、最后记录的修改（.eds 文件中最新的 ZIP 条目日期即最后保存时间）、仪器日志与校准。距运行超过 7 天的事件列在表中并标在图边缘。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Stored curves of the selected target. Colour = outcome under the active SOP; dashed vertical lines = SOP Cq cut\PYGZhy{}off and late\PYGZhy{}signal limit; horizontal line = stored threshold (QuantStudio ΔRn).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}所选靶标的保存曲线。颜色 = 当前 SOP 下的结果；竖虚线 = SOP Cq 截断值与晚期信号限值；横线 = 保存的阈值（QuantStudio ΔRn）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Every physical position. Choose what the colour shows: SOP outcome, stored Cq, end fluorescence, background, amplitude, or analysis status (which also shows wells with signal that are in no analysis, and omitted wells).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}全部物理孔位。可选择颜色表示：SOP 结果、保存的 Cq、终点荧光、背景、幅度或分析状态（同时显示有信号但未纳入分析的孔及被忽略的孔）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Rising fluorescence in positions that carry no result (unnamed wells, wells left out of every analysis, or wells without a target). These are the places where a sample may have been run but not reported.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}没有结果的孔位中出现的上升荧光（未命名孔、未纳入任何分析的孔或无靶标的孔）。这些位置可能进行了检测但未报告。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}One point per well. Colour by SOP outcome or by role. Red dashed line: Cq cut\PYGZhy{}off; orange: late\PYGZhy{}signal limit (per target).\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每孔一个点。按 SOP 结果或角色着色。红色虚线：Cq 截断值；橙色：晚期信号限值（按靶标）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}One point per sample and target with two or more detected replicates. The dashed line is the SOP maximum SD.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每个含两个及以上检出重复孔的样品/靶标一个点。虚线为 SOP 最大标准差。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cq against log10 of the stored standard quantity, fitted by least squares on this page. The label shows slope, R², efficiency and range against the SOP limits; residuals are in the table.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cq 对保存的标准品定量值 log10 作图，并在本页用最小二乘法拟合。标签显示斜率、R²、效率与范围及其与 SOP 限值的比较；残差见表格。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Cq of the targets the SOP marks as internal control or reference. The band is the run median ± the SOP maximum IC shift; points above it suggest inhibition or low input.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}SOP 标记为内控或参照基因的靶标 Cq。参考线为运行中位数及 SOP 允许的最大内控偏移；高于该线的点提示抑制或模板量低。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}End\PYGZhy{}point fluorescence (or amplitude above background) against the stored Cq. Late, low\PYGZhy{}plateau curves separate from true amplification; undetected wells are drawn at the right edge.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}终点荧光（或高于背景的幅度）与保存的 Cq 对比。晚期、低平台曲线与真实扩增可区分；未检出的孔绘于右侧边缘。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}For each detection channel / target: background (mean of cycles 3–10) and end\PYGZhy{}point fluorescence of every well, including wells outside the analyses. A shifted background points to plate, seal or optical problems.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每个检测通道 / 靶标：各孔的背景（第 3–10 循环平均值）与终点荧光，包括分析之外的孔。背景偏移提示板、封膜或光学问题。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Number of sample/target results per outcome under the active SOP, controls included.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}当前 SOP 下每种结果的样品/靶标结果数（含对照）。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}From the instrument log inside the .eds file: sample block mean, heated cover and the spread between block zones, against minutes from the first record. The dashed line is the SOP maximum zone spread.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}来自 .eds 文件中的仪器日志：样品模块平均温度、热盖温度与模块分区温差，横轴为距第一条记录的分钟数。虚线为 SOP 允许的最大分区温差。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}QuantStudio only: difference between the stored Ct and the crossing of the stored ΔRn with the stored threshold. Differences beyond ±0.2 require an algorithm/settings/provenance review; they do not prove that stored data were edited.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仅限 QuantStudio：保存的 Ct 与保存的 ΔRn 和保存阈值交点之间的差值。差值超过 ±0.2 表明 Ct 写入后阈值、基线或曲线被修改过。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Each run as a green dot at its start, with the experiment creation (blue, above) and the last recorded change (red, below, joined by a dashed line). Long gaps between run and last change are the first thing an auditor asks about.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每次运行以其开始时刻的绿点表示，实验创建（蓝色，上方）与最后记录的修改（红色，下方，以虚线相连）一并标出。运行与最后修改之间的长时间间隔是审核人员首先关注的问题。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Processing time per run. The dashed line is the SOP maximum; bars above it are flagged in the run acceptance.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}各运行的处理时间。虚线为 SOP 上限；超过上限的柱在运行验收中被标记。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Runs (rows) against the SOP criteria (columns): green met, amber review, red rejected, grey not applicable.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}运行（行）对照 SOP 标准（列）：绿色符合，琥珀色待审核，红色拒收，灰色不适用。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Stacked counts of sample/target outcomes for every loaded run.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每个已加载运行的样品/靶标结果堆叠计数。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Mean Cq of the chosen SOP control per run (Levey\PYGZhy{}Jennings style). Solid band: the Cq range written in the SOP; dotted lines: mean ± 2 SD and ± 3 SD of the loaded runs.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}所选 SOP 对照在各运行中的平均 Cq（Levey\PYGZhy{}Jennings 形式）。实色带：SOP 规定的 Cq 范围；点线：已加载运行的均值 ± 2 SD 与 ± 3 SD。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Median background and median end\PYGZhy{}point fluorescence of every channel per run: slow drift here is an instrument or reagent trend.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}各运行每个通道的背景中位数与终点荧光中位数：缓慢漂移反映仪器或试剂趋势。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Minutes from run start to run end, coloured by instrument. A run much shorter than its siblings with the same protocol deserves a look at the log.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}从运行开始到结束的分钟数，按仪器着色。若某运行明显短于同一程序的其他运行，应查看日志。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Count of error and review findings in the forensic log, grouped by area, largest first.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}取证日志中错误与待审核发现的数量，按领域分组，从多到少排列。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}LightCycler 480 — raw values, open formats and quality control\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}LightCycler 480 \PYGZhy{} 原始数据、开放格式与质量控制\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Reads a finished\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}读取已完成的\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}experiment, hands you the numbers the instrument stored, and writes them in formats that open\PYGZhy{}source tools read directly. Nothing is uploaded; everything runs in this page.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}实验，呈现仪器保存的数值，并导出为开源工具可直接读取的格式。数据不会上传，所有处理均在本页面中完成。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Reads a finished .ixo experiment, hands you the numbers the instrument stored, and writes them in formats that open\PYGZhy{}source tools read directly. Nothing is uploaded; everything runs in this page.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}读取已完成的 .ixo 实验，呈现仪器保存的数值，并导出为开源工具可直接读取的格式。数据不会上传，所有处理均在本页面中完成。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Language\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}语言\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}English\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}English\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}1 · Load files\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}1 · 加载文件\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · SOP\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}2 · SOP\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · Results\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}3 · 结果\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · Control panel\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}4 · 控制面板\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · Graphs\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}5 · 图表\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · Quality review\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · 质量审核\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · Quality \PYGZam{} forensic review\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}6 · 质量与取证审核\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}7 · Open formats\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}7 · 开放格式\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Load an experiment\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加载实验\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Drop one or more\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}拖入一个或多个\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}files, or a\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}文件，也可拖入包含这些文件的\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}containing them. Several runs can be loaded at once — the Quality review tab compares them.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}。可同时加载多个运行，并在“质量审核”中进行比较。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Drop one or more .ixo files, or a .zip containing them. Several runs can be loaded at once — the Quality review tab compares them.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}拖入一个或多个 .ixo 文件，也可拖入包含这些文件的 .zip。可同时加载多个运行，并在“质量审核”中进行比较。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Drop .ixo or .zip here\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}将 .ixo 或 .zip 拖到这里\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}or click to choose files\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}或点击选择文件\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Read the files\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}读取文件\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Or paste Cq values from any instrument\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}或粘贴任意仪器的 Cq 值\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}A pasted table can be tidied and downloaded again, but it carries no fluorescence, so the curve\PYGZhy{}based exports need an .ixo or .eds file. Paste or upload a table with a sample column and a Cq column — the header names are matched loosely, so exports from most instruments work as they are. A well column is used if present.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}粘贴的表格可整理后重新下载，但其中不含荧光数据，因此曲线类导出仍需要 .ixo 文件。请粘贴或上传包含样品列和 Cq 列的表格；系统会宽松匹配列名，如有孔位列也会一并使用。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Upload a CSV instead\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}改为上传 CSV\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Read pasted values\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}读取粘贴值\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Load the ENGL worked example\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}加载 ENGL 示例\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Read from the experiment file\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}从实验文件读取\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Everything below was taken out of the container itself. Nothing here was typed, assumed or defaulted — each line names the property it came from, so a value you disagree with can be traced back to the bytes it was read from.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}以下内容均直接来自实验容器，没有手工录入、推测或默认值。每一行都标明来源属性，便于追溯核对。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Download this table (CSV)\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}下载此表（CSV）\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}What was read\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}读取内容\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Stored values, exactly as the instrument wrote them\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}仪器保存的原始数值\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Nothing here is recomputed. Cq is the crossing point the LightCycler stored; concentration is its\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}此处不重新计算任何数值。Cq 为 LightCycler 保存的交叉点，浓度来自\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}; the call is its own classification. Download the table for your own analysis.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}；判定结果为仪器自身分类。可下载表格进行进一步分析。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Nothing here is recomputed. Cq is the crossing point the LightCycler stored; concentration is its CalcConc; the call is its own classification. Download the table for your own analysis.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}此处不重新计算任何数值。Cq 为 LightCycler 保存的交叉点，浓度来自 CalcConc，判定结果为仪器自身分类。可下载表格进行进一步分析。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
