\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Each download states which tool consumes it and what was checked. Where a format has a version that matters, the version that actually works is used rather than the newest or the oldest.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每项下载均说明适用工具及已完成的检查。若格式版本会影响兼容性，则采用实际验证可用的版本。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
