\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Inspect the plate, compare samples, review descriptive statistics, follow controls across experiments, inspect the stored curves, and audit the instrument record. Calculations are descriptive; stored Cq, calls and fluorescence are never replaced.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}查看板图、比较样品、审核描述性统计、跨实验跟踪对照、检查已保存的扩增曲线，并审计仪器记录。所有计算仅用于描述，不会替换仪器保存的 Cq、判定结果或荧光数据。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
