\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Every stored crossing point with its well, sample, target, role and call. The plain table most downstream work starts from.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}包含每个保存的交叉点及其孔位、样品、目标、角色和判定结果，是大多数后续分析的基础表格。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Stored Cq beside the full amplification curve, one row per cycle. The long\PYGZhy{}format table for scripts that expect tidy data.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}将保存的 Cq 与完整扩增曲线并列，每个循环一行，适用于长格式数据脚本。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Version 1.4 with every dye declared. rdmlpython refuses LinRegPCR below 1.4, and raises KeyError on a target whose dye was never declared; both were checked by running it.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}采用 RDML 1.4 并声明所有染料；已通过实际运行验证 rdmlpython / LinRegPCR 的兼容性。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}One column per well, first column named Cycles exactly as pcrbatch() demands. Column names carry target and sample so replicate groups form with one sub().\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}每个孔位一列，首列按 pcrbatch() 要求命名为 Cycles；列名包含目标和样品，便于构建重复孔组。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Melting temperature, peak area and peak height for every well, as the Tm Calling analysis stored them. Only runs that carry such an analysis produce this.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}包含 Tm Calling 分析保存的每孔熔解温度、峰面积和峰高，仅对含此类分析的运行提供。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Every setting the page could read out of the container, each with the property it came from. The same table shown on the Load tab.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}列出页面从容器读取的全部设置及其来源属性，与“加载”页显示的表格相同。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}Every table above plus both scripts, so a whole experiment can be handed over in a single file.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{o}{:}\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}包含上述所有表格和两个脚本，可用单个文件交付完整实验。\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
