\PYG{c+cm}{   S. Laboratory SOP profile and interpretation}
\PYG{c+cm}{   \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}}
\PYG{c+cm}{   A profile is a small JSON document that states the laboratory\PYGZsq{}s own}
\PYG{c+cm}{   acceptance and interpretation rules. The page never changes a stored Cq or}
\PYG{c+cm}{   call: it applies the profile on top of the stored values and writes the}
\PYG{c+cm}{   outcome, the reason and the rule that produced it next to each result.}
\PYG{c+cm}{   Every export carries the profile name, version and SHA\PYGZhy{}256.}
\PYG{c+cm}{   ============================================================ */}
