\PYG{c+cm}{/* The console is a mode, not a page. Its top row selects which part of the data set the}
\PYG{c+cm}{   console is working on; it never changes the mode. Leaving is one explicit action. */}
\PYG{c+cm}{/* ============================================================}
\PYG{c+cm}{   The console as a data console, not only an alarm queue.}
\PYG{c+cm}{   \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}}
\PYG{c+cm}{   Each of the seven names on the top row is a VIEW with its own builder. A view}
\PYG{c+cm}{   reports what that part of the data set holds, whether or not anything is wrong,}
\PYG{c+cm}{   so the top row never leads to an empty screen. Every item carries a pictogram}
\PYG{c+cm}{   for the kind of object, a state glyph with its word, a headline number, and a}
\PYG{c+cm}{   detail list of the numbers behind it. Nothing here recomputes a measurement:}
\PYG{c+cm}{   the builders read the same functions the page\PYGZsq{}s own views read.}
\PYG{c+cm}{   ============================================================ */}
