\PYG{c+cm}{/* The key is the CONDITION, not the occurrence: experiment and well are what a}
\PYG{c+cm}{   finding is counted across, so putting them in the key would make every row}
\PYG{c+cm}{   unique and the count identical to the raw one. Well identifiers inside the}
\PYG{c+cm}{   finding text are folded out for the same reason.}
\PYG{c+cm}{   Severity stays IN the key on purpose. The same check can end as information in}
\PYG{c+cm}{   one run and as a review item in another \PYGZhy{} a change 3 h after a run and one 24 h}
\PYG{c+cm}{   after it are the same sentence with different numbers \PYGZhy{} and merging those would}
\PYG{c+cm}{   report every run at the worst outcome any run reached. Analytical identity is}
\PYG{c+cm}{   already carried by the text: a control failure names its control and its target,}
\PYG{c+cm}{   so two controls do not merge. What the text cannot hold is reported instead:}
\PYG{c+cm}{   every group counts how many distinct pieces of evidence it covers. */}
